msgstr "Mga pagbabago sa feature ng Qiskit v1.0 {#qiskit-v10-feature-changes}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide describes migration paths for the most important feature changes in Qiskit v1.0, organized by module.\n"
"Use the table of contents on the right side to navigate to the module you are interested in.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inilalarawan ng gabay na ito ang mga migration path para sa pinakamahalagang pagbabago sa feature sa Qiskit v1.0, na nakaayos ayon sa module.\n"
"Gamitin ang talaan ng nilalaman sa kanang bahagi para mag-navigate sa module na gusto mo.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit v1.0 migration tool {#qiskit-v10-migration-tool}"
msgstr "Migration tool ng Qiskit v1.0 {#qiskit-v10-migration-tool}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To ease the migration process, you can use the\n"
"[`flake8-qiskit-migration`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration)\n"
"tool to detect removed import paths in your code and suggest alternatives.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para mapadali ang proseso ng migration, maaari kang gumamit ng\n"
"[`flake8-qiskit-migration`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration)\n"
"tool para matukoy ang mga tinanggal na import path sa iyong code at magmungkahi ng mga alternatibo.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-pipx\" label=\"Run with pipx\" default>\n"
"      If you have [`pipx`](https://github.com/pypa/pipx) installed, simply run\n"
"      the following command.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-pipx\" label=\"Patakbuhin gamit ang pipx\" default>\n"
"      Kung naka-install ang [`pipx`](https://github.com/pypa/pipx), patakbuhin lang\n"
"      ang sumusunod na command.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      pipx run flake8-qiskit-migration <path-to-source-directory>\n"
"      ```\n"
"      This will install the package to a temporary virtual environment and run\n"
"      it on your code.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-venv\" label=\"Run with venv\" default>\n"
"      If you don't want to use `pipx`, you can manually create a new\n"
"      environment for the tool. This approach also lets you use\n"
"      [`nbqa`](https://github.com/nbQA-dev/nbQA) to check code examples in\n"
"      Jupyter notebooks. Delete the environment when you're finished.\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      pipx run flake8-qiskit-migration <path-to-source-directory>\n"
"      ```\n"
"      I-i-install nito ang package sa isang pansamantalang virtual environment at\n"
"      ipapatakbo ito sa iyong code.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-venv\" label=\"Patakbuhin gamit ang venv\" default>\n"
"      Kung ayaw mong gumamit ng `pipx`, maaari kang manu-manong gumawa ng bagong\n"
"      environment para sa tool. Pinapahintulutan ka rin ng paraang ito na gumamit ng\n"
"      [`nbqa`](https://github.com/nbQA-dev/nbQA) para suriin ang mga code example sa\n"
"      Jupyter notebooks. I-delete ang environment kapag tapos ka na.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      # Make new environment and install\n"
"      python -m venv .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      source .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv/bin/activate\n"
"      pip install flake8-qiskit-migration\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      # Make new environment and install\n"
"      python -m venv .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      source .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv/bin/activate\n"
"      pip install flake8-qiskit-migration\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Run plugin on Python code\n"
"      flake8 --select QKT100 <path-to-source-directory>  # e.g. `src/`\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Run plugin on Python code\n"
"      flake8 --select QKT100 <path-to-source-directory>  # e.g. `src/`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # (Optional) run plugin on notebooks\n"
"      pip install nbqa\n"
"      nbqa flake8 ./**/*.ipynb --select QKT100\n"
msgstr ""
"      # (Optional) run plugin on notebooks\n"
"      pip install nbqa\n"
"      nbqa flake8 ./**/*.ipynb --select QKT100\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Deactivate and delete environment\n"
"      deactivate\n"
"      rm -r .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Deactivate and delete environment\n"
"      deactivate\n"
"      rm -r .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limitations\">\n"
"This tool only detects removed import paths. It does not detect the use of removed\n"
"methods (such as `QuantumCircuit.qasm`) or arguments. It also can't keep track\n"
"of assignments such as `qk = qiskit`, although it can handle aliases such as\n"
"`import qiskit as qk`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga limitasyon\">\n"
"Natutukoy lang ng tool na ito ang mga tinanggal na import path. Hindi nito natutukoy ang paggamit ng mga tinanggal na\n"
"method (tulad ng `QuantumCircuit.qasm`) o ng mga argument. Hindi rin nito sinusubaybayan ang\n"
"mga assignment tulad ng `qk = qiskit`, kahit kaya nitong hawakan ang mga alias tulad ng\n"
"`import qiskit as qk`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information, see the [project's\n"
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, tingnan ang [repository ng\n"
"proyekto](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration).\n"

