# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "execute {#execute}"
msgstr "execute {#execute}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.execute` function is not available in Qiskit v1.0. This\n"
"function served as a high-level wrapper around the\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) and\n"
"[`run`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run) functions in Qiskit.\n"
"Instead of `qiskit.execute`, use the\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) function followed by\n"
"[`backend.run()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run).\n"
msgstr ""
"Hindi available ang `qiskit.execute` function sa Qiskit v1.0. Ang function na ito ay nagsilbing isang mataas na antas na wrapper sa paligid ng\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) at\n"
"[`run`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run) na mga function sa Qiskit.\n"
"Sa halip na `qiskit.execute`, gamitin ang\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) function na sinusundan ng\n"
"[`backend.run()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the [Sampler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Sampler)\n"
"primitive is semantically equivalent to the removed `qiskit.execute`\n"
"function. The class\n"
"[`BackendSampler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.BackendSampler) is a\n"
"generic wrapper for backends that do not support primitives:\n"
msgstr ""
"Bilang alternatibo, ang [Sampler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Sampler)\n"
"primitive ay semantically katumbas ng tinanggal na `qiskit.execute`\n"
"function. Ang klase na\n"
"[`BackendSampler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.BackendSampler) ay isang\n"
"generic na wrapper para sa mga backend na hindi sumusuporta sa mga primitive:\n"

