# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updates in the V1 interface {#updates-in-the-v1-interface}"
msgstr "Mga update sa V1 interface {#updates-in-the-v1-interface}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* Implicit conversion from a dense `BaseOperator` to a\n"
"  [`SparsePauliOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp) in\n"
"  [`Estimator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Estimator) observable arguments\n"
"  is no longer allowed. You should explicitly convert to a `SparsePauliOp`\n"
"by using\n"
"  [`SparsePauliOp.from_operator(operator)`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp#from_operator)\n"
"  instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"* Hindi na pinapayagan ang implicit conversion mula sa dense na `BaseOperator` patungo sa\n"
"  [`SparsePauliOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp) sa mga\n"
"  observable argument ng [`Estimator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Estimator).\n"
"  Dapat mo itong i-convert nang explicit sa isang `SparsePauliOp`\n"
"sa pamamagitan ng paggamit ng\n"
"  [`SparsePauliOp.from_operator(operator)`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp#from_operator)\n"
"  sa halip.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using a [`PauliList`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliList) in\n"
"Estimator observable arguments is no longer allowed. Instead you should\n"
"explicitly convert the argument by using\n"
"[`SparsePauliOp(pauli_list)`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp)\n"
"first.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hindi na pinahihintulutan ang paggamit ng [`PauliList`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliList) sa\n"
"mga observable argument ng Estimator. Sa halip, dapat mong\n"
"explicit na i-convert ang argument gamit ang\n"
"[`SparsePauliOp(pauli_list)`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp)\n"
"muna.\n"

