"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install qiskit-aer\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Support for running pulse jobs on backends from\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.fake_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_fake_provider) has\n"
"been removed in Qiskit v1.0.  This is because Qiskit Aer removed its\n"
"simulation functionality for such jobs.  For low-level Hamiltonian-simulation\n"
"workloads, consider using a specialized library such as [Qiskit\n"
"Dynamics](https://qiskit-extensions.github.io/qiskit-dynamics/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang suporta sa pagpapatakbo ng mga pulse job sa mga backend mula sa\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.fake_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_fake_provider) ay\n"
"inalis na sa Qiskit v1.0. Ito ay dahil inalis ng Qiskit Aer ang\n"
"simulation functionality para sa ganitong mga job. Para sa mga low-level na Hamiltonian-simulation\n"
"na workload, isaalang-alang ang paggamit ng espesyalisadong library tulad ng [Qiskit\n"
"Dynamics](https://qiskit-extensions.github.io/qiskit-dynamics/).\n"

