"be injected in the builder context by manually transpiling and scheduling the\n"
"object.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gayundin, ang [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) ay maaaring\n"
"i-inject sa builder context sa pamamagitan ng manu-manong pag-transpile at pag-schedule ng\n"
"object.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recommend writing a minimum pulse program with the builder and attaching it to\n"
"`QuantumCircuit` through the\n"
"[`QuantumCircuit.add_calibration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#add_calibration)\n"
"method as a microcode of a gate instruction, rather than writing the entire\n"
"program with the pulse model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inirerekomenda naming sumulat ng minimal na pulse program gamit ang builder at ilakip ito sa\n"
"`QuantumCircuit` sa pamamagitan ng\n"
"[`QuantumCircuit.add_calibration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#add_calibration)\n"
"method bilang microcode ng isang gate instruction, sa halip na isulat ang buong\n"
"program gamit ang pulse model.\n"

