# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.tools.events` module and the `progressbar()` utility it exposed\n"
"have been removed. This module's functionality was not widely used and is\n"
"better covered by dedicated packages such as\n"
"[tqdm](https://github.com/tqdm/tqdm).\n"
msgstr "Ang `qiskit.tools.events` module at ang `progressbar()` utility na inilantad nito ay tinanggal na. Ang functionality ng module na ito ay hindi gaanong ginagamit at mas maayos na naka-cover ng mga dedicated na package tulad ng [tqdm](https://github.com/tqdm/tqdm).\n"

